(1, 1, 'Adipisci minima nesc', 'Minima modi officia', '<p><br></p><div class=\"blog-item-top-wrapper\" style=\"margin-bottom: 50px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins;\"><div class=\"blog-item-meta-wrapper\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; flex-wrap: wrap; order: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><div class=\"blog-meta-item blog-meta-item--categories\" data-content-field=\"categories\" style=\"line-height: 19.2px;\"><span class=\"blog-item-category-wrapper\" style=\"line-height: 19.2px;\"><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/category/scrittura\" class=\"blog-item-category blog-item-category--scrittura\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none; font-family: Poppins; font-weight: 400; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">writing</font></a></span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"enhanced-356dcefa-0749-46da-86c5-7c36a1aa6cfe.png\" style=\"width: 938.094px;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"blog-item-content-wrapper\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_74\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins;\"><div class=\"blog-item-content e-content\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_73\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 3vw;\"><div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-670e20dbb57c5c0e484f3beb\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_72\" style=\"width: auto !important; margin-left: -17px; margin-right: -17px;\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_71\" style=\"float: left; width: 879.344px; padding-right: 0px;\"><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image sqs-text-ready\" data-block-type=\"5\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1731406809906_11058\" style=\"position: relative; height: auto; padding: 0px 17px 17px; clear: both;\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_70\"><div class=\"image-block-outer-wrapper layout-caption-hidden design-layout-inline combination-animation-site-default individual-animation-site-default individual-text-animation-site-default animation-loaded\" data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_69\" style=\"transform: translateZ(0px);\"><figure class=\"\r\n              sqs-block-image-figure\r\n              intrinsic\r\n            \" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_68\" style=\"margin-right: auto; margin-left: auto; max-width: 1500px;\"><div class=\"image-block-wrapper\" data-animation-role=\"image\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_67\" style=\"min-height: 1px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div class=\"sqs-image-shape-container-element\r\n              \r\n          \r\n        \r\n              has-aspect-ratio\r\n            \" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1776593179649_66\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 563.562px; overflow: hidden; mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(center, white, black);\"><img data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"1500x1000\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"\" data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1000\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/670e17c99818dc713e4bfa64/1731406792490-F6ABRS7FGVY5MTA7DSZA/scrivere-blog-post.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\" class=\"loaded\" style=\"border: 0px; position: absolute; width: 845.344px; display: block; object-fit: cover; height: 563.562px; object-position: 50% 50%;\"></div></div></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2bc79ad-708e-42c6-a166-227d0d9aeb48_462/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2bc79ad-708e-42c6-a166-227d0d9aeb48_462/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"670e20dbb57c5c0e484f3bec\" id=\"block-670e20dbb57c5c0e484f3bec\" style=\"position: relative; height: auto; padding: 17px; clear: none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); --tweak-text-block-radius: unset; --stroke-style: none; --stroke-thickness: 6px; --tweak-text-block-background-color: initial; mix-blend-mode: normal;\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\"><div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\" style=\"outline: none; position: relative; z-index: 0; --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">How many times have you started </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">writing a blog post</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> and, after a few lines, deleted the whole thing because you didn\'t know how to continue?</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Your problem isn\'t so much what to say—you have the content clearly in your head—but you struggle to organize the information in a way that\'s enjoyable, interesting, and effective.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">In short, you have </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">performance anxiety</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> .</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Don\'t worry, what you need is a thread to follow, a guide that helps you </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">plan good content and structure it properly even before writing it</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> .</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Let\'s learn together how it\'s done.</font></p><h2 style=\"margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 58.2042px; letter-spacing: -3.136px; font-size: 44.8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Writing a blog post: start with the planning</font></h2><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Imagine a blog post as a staircase (you decide whether it\'s a fruit staircase, a spiral staircase, or one of those beautiful decorative stairs you use to hang towels on in the bathroom): each step is a piece of your article, a subtopic of the theme you\'ve decided to cover.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Thinking this way is important because those who come across your content can:</font></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">decide to read it all in one go;</font></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><em style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">skip a few steps</font></em><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> and concentrate on reading a passage;</font></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">run your eyes over it and get the general gist of what you want to say.</font></p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">This is why when you write you can\'t go by feeling (you can do it if you then do a </font><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/revisione-testo\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">good job of revising</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> ), but you have to work on planning to ensure that, whatever the attitude, the reader </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;receives the message you want to send at the level of depth they desire</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> .</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">How to Design a Blog Post</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Let\'s say your next blog post is about the Christmas markets in Trentino-Alto Adige. Organize your content by breaking it down into the steps we discussed earlier, as I\'ve done below.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Title</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Introduction</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"mar