"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">H3. Where to sleep</font></strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Hotel, bed &amp; breakfast or mountain house?</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Conclusion</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . Repeat the opening sentence and add a discount code for those who book at one of the hotels mentioned.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">This way, you can be sure you\'ll remember everything, and nothing stops you from adding, deleting, or moving individual paragraphs. This is still a rough outline that can be written and rewritten as you like. 😉</font></p><h2 style=\"margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 58.2042px; letter-spacing: -3.136px; font-size: 44.8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">And then? How do you write a blog post that works?</font></h2><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">A blog post is made up of valuable pieces that set it apart from other website content, such as </font><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/come-scrivere-labout-page\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">about pages</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> and </font><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/sales-page-efficaci\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">sales pages</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . Let\'s look at them one by one.</font></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Captivating title</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . </font><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/come-scrivere-un-headline-efficace\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Your title</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> should give a taste of the post\'s topic, pique curiosity, and entice people to learn more.</font></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Introduction</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . These are the first lines of text, where you need to capture the attention of those who click on the post and encourage them to continue reading.</font></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Body</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . The heart of your article, well-explained and formatted with links, bold text, bullet points, and paragraphs that </font><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/come-si-legge-su-internet\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">aid reading</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> and </font><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/consigli-di-copywriting-tecniche-per-farsi-leggere-di-piu-e-meglio\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">understanding</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> .</font></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Conclusion</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . It tends to often get forgotten, but closing a post is just as crucial as the rest; it\'s an opportunity to build relationships and tell people what to do next.</font></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Images</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . Post images reinforce what you\'re trying to communicate, they visually represent your content, and help make it clearer.</font></p></li></ul><h2 style=\"margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 58.2042px; letter-spacing: -3.136px; font-size: 44.8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Ideas for starting a post with examples</font></h2><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Okay, now that you\'ve structured your blog post and learned its anatomy, get the ball rolling with a captivating introduction. Not sure how to do it? Feeling anxious again? Don\'t worry: here are some ideas, complete with real-world examples, to </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">get you off to a flying start with writing your posts</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> .</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Let\'s analyze them one by one.</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Get to the point</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">If you\'re unsure where to begin, </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">skip the preamble and get straight to the point</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> : briefly summarize the article\'s content and immediately explain why people should read it. Abandon frills and embellishments, aim for simplicity and concreteness.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Example</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . </font><a href=\"https://www.ljuba.it/blog/landing-page-sondaggio-mailerlite/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">How to Create a Landing Page with a Survey Using MailerLite</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> , by Ljuba Daviè</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">In this article, we\'ve already seen how to add a survey to your newsletters using MailerLite\'s new interactive blocks. But did you know you can also integrate surveys into your landing pages?</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">No rambling or beating around the bush: in just a few lines, Ljuba tells us what the post is about. Immediate and effective.</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Magic, the problem no longer exists</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Starting with your audience\'s needs is a good starting point for building engaging content. There are many ways to do this, one of the most popular is to </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">start with a question</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> —which, coincidentally, is the exact same question the person on the other end of the screen is asking about a certain topic—and the answer to this question is none other than the content of your post.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Example</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . </font><a href=\"https://www.macrobioticamente.com/contraccezione-naturale-daysy/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Natural Contraception – Daysy</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> , Macrobiotically</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Are there any valid alternatives to hormonal contraception? Can we replace the pill with something more natural and without side effects? The answer, fortunately, is yes! Meet Daysy.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Here Silvia presents an alternative contraceptive method to the traditional pill and, to capture our attention, writes down in black and white the questions that might arise from readers who are sensitive to the topic but, at the same time, poorly informed.</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Once upon a time, but nowadays</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">I\'ve explained this to you several times: storytelling appeals to our emotions and connects the writer with their audience. No, you don\'t have to become a storyteller or tell a Cinderella story; start with your own personal experiences and use them to introduce your post.&nbsp;</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Example. </font><a href=\"https://www.silviasola.it/blog/testi-annunci-immobiliari\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">I\'m used to real estate ads</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> , Silvia Sola</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">\"I\'m used to real estate ad copy: I spent the last two years reading and rereading it while looking for the perfect home for Michele and I. Okay, so it\'s not true that I\'m used to it.\"</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">In this post, I\'ll begin with a story of disappointment, my own. I\'m disheartened because real estate ads don\'t think about people; they\'re full of abstruse and repetitive forms. Even if the topic of the post doesn\'t immediately strike you, anyone who\'s had a similar experience will connect with the writer from the first few lines and will want to see it through to the end.</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Numbers are sexy</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">It\'s not me who says this, but research does. Statistics are appealing and catch our attention, whether they\'re included in a headline or at the beginning of an article. Numbers and percentages lend greater credibility and reinforce what you\'ll say in the following lines.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Example</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . </font><a href=\"https://vincos.it/2021/02/13/la-mappa-delle-app-piu-usate-nel-mondo-2021/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">The Map of the Most Used Apps in the World - 2021</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> , Vincos</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">“2020 was a bumper year for mobile app usage. Despite spending more time at home, downloads increased (+7%), but more importantly, hours of use increased (4.2 hours per person, +20%) and money spent through apps increased (€143 billion, +20%).”</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">In this post, Vincenzo Cosenza starts off with a simple fact: despite the pandemic, mobile apps have remained a widely used tool. Using <b>numbers</b>, he explains which apps are most popular, including a ranking.</font></p><h2 style=\"margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 58.2042px; letter-spacing: -3.136px; font-size: 44.8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Ideas for finishing a post with examples</font></h2><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">So far, everything clear? Great, now let\'s talk about the conclusion. Closing a post is just as important as starting it. A meaningless, flat, or—worse—nonexistent ending sends the wrong message to the person on the other end, something like \"I don\'t care what you think\" instead of \"stay with me and tell me what you think.\"</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">So here are some tips to help you find a </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">worthy conclusion for your posts</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> : there are no rules or patterns that work better than others, my advice is, as always, to try and experiment.</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">The ball is in your audience\'s court</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">This is the </font><em style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">classic method</font></em><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> : ask people to </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">tell you about their experience</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> , to share a thought, to take action. Use this closing to foster an exchange of ideas between you and the reader, build relationships, and invite comments, as Marzia did with her #5minutidifotografia project.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Example: </font><a href=\"https://marziaallietta.it/street-photography-esercizi-di-fotografia-errante/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Down on the Street, Small Exercises in Wandering Photography</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> , Marzia Allietta</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">\"And you, will you jog through your city, through a forest, cross the streets of your town 100 steps at a time? I can\'t wait to see where you\'ll take me... show me what your eyes have set on by posting your shots with the hashtag #5minutidifotografia... I\'ll be waiting for you over there, on Instagram!\"</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Closing the circle</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">This approach is an elegant, simple, and incredibly useful way to help people </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">understand what you\'ve written</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . Daniela concludes her article by summarizing the key points to help readers remember the key concepts.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Example: </font><a href=\"https://erboristeriacalendula.it/alimentazione/acqua-e-limone-al-mattino-benefici/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Lemon water in the morning: benefits and alternatives</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> , Calendula Herbalist\'s Shop</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">We\'ve reached the end of this journey: we\'ve explored the benefits of lemon water and flaxseed tea, learned the importance of small gestures like cleaning with a tongue scraper or meditation, and that even a simple smile can make your day better. All that\'s left for me to do is wish you a good morning: as always, if you need help with your body\'s well-being, I\'m here!</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Reflections and inspirations</font></h1><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">You know those posts that, once you finish reading them, make you want to stand up and applaud nonstop? That happens to me when the writer manages to </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">leave me with a lesson</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . Stimulate me. </font><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Give me the energy to do something</font></strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> . Like in the post below.</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Example: </font><a href=\"https://www.digitalic.it/internet/web/scrittura-creativa-si-puo-stimolare\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-image: unset; background-position: unset; background-size: unset; background-repeat: unset; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(91, 126, 150); text-decoration: underline 1px; white-space: initial; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">Creative writing. Can it be stimulated?,</font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\"> Digitalic</font></p><p class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 28.8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">“In closing, let me give you some advice: be kind to yourself; love what you do; don\'t judge yourself; have fun; play. Write a lot, make a lot of mistakes. Work hard and smile. Because only in this way—perhaps—creativity will smile on you too.”</font></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 57.6px; margin: 2rem 0px; font-family: Poppins; line-height: 72.2534px; letter-spacing: -4.032px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: inherit;\">The beauty of waiting</font></h1></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>', 'https://www.zodiqexucom.us', 'Ea ipsum dolorem mo', 'https://www.lesajysyzumyt.ws', 'ethiopia', 'processing', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-19 08:09:00', '2026-04-19 08:09:00');

